@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@userId = 1
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 1


### 1. 正常创建订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1
}


### 2. 快速重复创建订单
### 请与第 1 个请求并发或在第 1 个请求未完成时立即执行，用于验证 SET NX 拦截正在处理的重复提交
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1
}


### 3. 库存不足场景
### 数量设置为明显超过当前 availableStock 的值，仍应由 MySQL 条件扣库存逻辑返回库存不足
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 999999
}


### 4. 查询库存展示变化
### 如此前执行过票档查询缓存，请先删除 session:ticket-categories:{{sessionId}}，避免读到旧缓存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/ticket-categories
